2. ALLELE DATA — PubMLST AND INSTITUT PASTEUR
================================================================================

The database shipped in db/pubmlst/ (162 schemes, 1,108 locus files, 225,777
allele records, snapshot 2025-12-29) was retrieved from the public, anonymous
REST endpoints of:

    PubMLST                 https://rest.pubmlst.org
    BIGSdb Pasteur          https://bigsdb.pasteur.fr/api

The allele sequences and sequence-type profiles are the property of their
respective curators and depositors and are redistributed here unmodified, byte
for byte, under the terms those sites publish for anonymous access. They are
DATA, not part of the Program, and are not covered by the GPL.

If you use WMLST, or this data, in work you publish, you MUST cite:

    Jolley KA, Bray JE, Maiden MCJ (2018)
    "Open-access bacterial population genomics: BIGSdb software, the PubMLST.org
    website and their applications."
    Wellcome Open Research 3:124.
    doi:10.12688/wellcomeopenres.14826.1   PMID: 30345391

Individual schemes may carry their own curator-requested citation; see the
"description" and "API" fields of db/pubmlst/<scheme>/<scheme>_info.json.

